  "title": "# Token control, Fable phase (Urgent orchestrator build `token-control`, s1-s3 only) Brett Nov 2 20…",
  "asked": "# Token control, Fable phase (Urgent orchestrator build `token-control`, s1-s3 only) Brett Nov 2 2026 21:38 ET, launched Nov 3: new plugin with a powerful API, MCP and CLI server/client that can change every single token (theme, style, layout); every layout parameter is a token. MCP, API and CLI connect to Claude and axHub. API and MCP control every aspect of AmberX tasks, to-dos and notes, and the console planner (both Plan Studio and the Build orchestrator). Extensive interactive documentation. Folds in the old amberx-full-mcp-api build (deletes need confirm). First run: `AXF_BUILD_PROFILE=urgent node apps/console-web/plugins/build-orchestrator/orchestrator.mjs brief token-control` for the full step list. THIS run does only the Fable steps, then stops: [ ] s1 (~30m) Every layout parameter becomes a [hidden] asset type/schema, engine, fixtures (audit what's still literal) [ ] s2 (~30m) Layout tokens reach every framework component; check-theme flags any layout literal [ ] s3 (~30m) control@1 contract: one command schema for tokens (list/get/set/reset across theme, style, layout), AmberX entities (tasks, to-dos, notes, everything), planner (Plan Studio plans + orchestrator builds); auth; deletes need confirm Tick each: AXF_BUILD_PROFILE=urgent node apps/console-web/plugins/build-orchestrator/orchestrator.mjs act step token-control <sN> done. Coordinate with the running molly-fable build (dock engine + xlayout) by reading origin/main before touching framework/core/engines/layout or windows. Rules: one session, no sub-agents; steps <= 30 min. Tokens only (--fx-*), framework controls, no var() fallbacks; check-theme and check-controls pass. Reference engine changed -> regenerate framework/spec/fixtures (npx -y tsx framework/spec/gen-fixtures.mts). Android on hold: Kotlin twins are deferred gaps in framework/spec/PORTING.md. Update the token-control row in _claude/THREADS.md each step; at the end write its To carry on block for the Opus phase (s4-s14). Commit + push branch claude/token-control often; open the PR at the end (push banner merges it). Watch live: Brett can watch the screen you are changing hot-render in the console. Whenever you start work on a screen or element, run `node framework/cli/axf.mjs focus <app> [route] [css-selector] --note \"<what you are changing>\"` (apps: console-web, axhub-web, amberx-droid, patches-web, walkthrough-studio, demo, framework, console, axhub-android, voicevault). Agent cap: heavy steps (pnpm/npm/vite builds, docker node:22 test runs, Playwright) share a VPS-wide lock. Run each one as `node /opt/axf/deploy/../framework/cli/agent-slots.mjs heavy -- <command>` so only a few run at once.",
